# ==============================================================================
# CHANGE: QR Code Feature Stage 2 — 2026-11-05
# Smart Link Management Platform - Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# Public API & Short Link Redirect Base URL
#
# 1. Local Development (Same machine browser testing):
#    Default: http://localhost:5000
#    QR codes will encode: http://localhost:5000/api/links/:shortCode
#
# 2. Local Mobile Network Testing:
#    If scanning with a mobile phone on the same local Wi-Fi, 'localhost' on the
#    phone refers to the phone itself. To test mobile scanning locally, configure
#    your machine's local IPv4 address (e.g., http://192.168.1.45:5000) or an
#    HTTP tunnel (e.g., ngrok/cloudflared):
#    VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.45:5000
#
# 3. Production Deployment:
#    Set this to your live production API domain so QR codes scanned anywhere
#    worldwide hit the redirect service:
#    VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000
